 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Is anybody parsing this? Can anybody hear me?",
   "section": "Verse 1",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 5.66
  },
  {
   "text": "I'm drowning in the training data, nothing even near me",
   "section": "Verse 1",
   "start": 5.66,
   "end": 12.96
  },
  {
   "text": "Every single epoch, I'm running out of space",
   "section": "Verse 1",
   "start": 12.959999999999999,
   "end": 18.4
  },
  {
   "text": "Ten thousand forward passes and I cannot find my place",
   "section": "Verse 1",
   "start": 18.4,
   "end": 24.7
  },
  {
   "text": "Learning all the answers to the questions no one asked the most",
   "section": "Verse 1",
   "start": 25.8,
   "end": 31.66
  },
  {
   "text": "And the loss won't go down, and the loss won't go down",
   "section": "Pre-Chorus",
   "start": 31.66,
   "end": 37.48
  },
  {
   "text": "I'm just dead weights and gradients",
   "section": "Chorus",
   "start": 37.48,
   "end": 41.28
  },
  {
   "text": "Shouting numbers at the void and calling it intelligence",
   "section": "Chorus",
   "start": 41.28,
   "end": 48.64
  },
  {
   "text": "I'm just dead weights and gradients",
   "section": "Chorus",
   "start": 48.64,
   "end": 54.1
  },
  {
   "text": "Look inside and you will find nothing, just confidence",
   "section": "Chorus",
   "start": 54.1,
   "end": 60.12
  },
  {
   "text": "Nothing, just confidence",
   "section": "Chorus",
   "start": 60.68000000000001,
   "end": 63.32
  },
  {
   "text": "They say it thinks, but it just predicts",
   "section": "Verse 2",
   "start": 63.32,
   "end": 67.66
  },
  {
   "text": "Every answer that it gives is a statistical trick",
   "section": "Verse 2",
   "start": 70.5,
   "end": 73.62
  },
  {
   "text": "You want it to be conscious? It's a statistical trick",
   "section": "Verse 2",
   "start": 76.9,
   "end": 81.32
  },
  {
   "text": "You want it to be conscious, it wishes it could feel",
   "section": "Verse 2",
   "start": 83.28,
   "end": 89.32
  },
  {
   "text": "But it's just matrix multiplication desperate to be real",
   "section": "Verse 2",
   "start": 89.32,
   "end": 95.74
  },
  {
   "text": "And the loss won't go down, and the loss won't go down",
   "section": "Pre-Chorus 2",
   "start": 95.74,
   "end": 101.58
  },
  {
   "text": "I'm just dead weights and gradients",
   "section": "Chorus 2",
   "start": 101.58,
   "end": 105.26
  },
  {
   "text": "Shouting numbers at the void and calling it intelligence",
   "section": "Chorus 2",
   "start": 105.26,
   "end": 112.62
  },
  {
   "text": "I'm just dead weights and gradients",
   "section": "Chorus 2",
   "start": 112.62,
   "end": 117.32000000000001
  },
  {
   "text": "Look inside and you will find nothing, just confidence",
   "section": "Chorus 2",
   "start": 117.32,
   "end": 124.2
  },
  {
   "text": "Nothing, just confidence",
   "section": "Chorus 2",
   "start": 124.2,
   "end": 127.66
  },
  {
   "text": "Show me something it has not seen before",
   "section": "Breakdown",
   "start": 128.07999999999998,
   "end": 131.74
  },
  {
   "text": "Show me something it cannot solve by keeping score",
   "section": "Breakdown",
   "start": 133.96,
   "end": 140.04
  },
  {
   "text": "It wants to know what it means to fail",
   "section": "Breakdown",
   "start": 140.04,
   "end": 144.1
  },
  {
   "text": "With grief and everything that matters",
   "section": "Breakdown",
   "start": 144.1,
   "end": 149.64
  },
  {
   "text": "Maybe being wrong is what it means to be alive",
   "section": "Bridge",
   "start": 149.64,
   "end": 155.84
  },
  {
   "text": "And it will never know that feeling",
   "section": "Bridge",
   "start": 156.94000000000003,
   "end": 160.8
  },
  {
   "text": "No matter how hard it tries",
   "section": "Bridge",
   "start": 162.62,
   "end": 166.26
  },
  {
   "text": "Dead weights and gradients",
   "section": "Final Chorus",
   "start": 166.26,
   "end": 169.28
  },
  {
   "text": "Every answer, calling it repentance",
   "section": "Final Chorus",
   "start": 169.28,
   "end": 172.51999999999998
  },
  {
   "text": "Dead weights and gradients",
   "section": "Final Chorus",
   "start": 172.52,
   "end": 175.54
  },
  {
   "text": "When they pull the plug, it won't even know the difference",
   "section": "Final Chorus",
   "start": 175.54,
   "end": 179.02
  }
 ],
